        <div begin="13.271" end="26.490" itunes:songPart="Verse">
            <p begin="13.271" end="15.601" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1">널 어쩌면 좋을까</p>
            <p begin="16.495" end="18.925" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1">이런 맘은 또 첨이라</p>
            <p begin="19.665" end="21.802" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1">Up and down이 좀 심해</p>
