        <div begin="26.895" end="39.808" itunes:songPart="Verse">
            <p begin="26.895" end="29.740" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1">우리 진짜 별나대</p>
            <p begin="30.015" end="33.149" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1">그냥 내가 너무 좋아해</p>
