        </div>
        <div begin="53.821" end="1:22.103" itunes:songPart="Chorus">
            <p begin="53.821" end="57.491" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1">You got me feeling like a psycho, psycho</p>
            <p begin="57.535" end="1:00.761" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1">우릴 보고 말해 자꾸 자꾸</p>
            <p begin="1:00.980" end="1:04.977" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1">다시 안 볼 듯 싸우다가도 붙어다니니 말야</p>
            <p begin="1:05.356" end="1:08.446" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1">이해가 안 간대 웃기지도 않대</p>
            <p begin="1:08.543" end="1:10.804" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1">맞아 Psycho, psycho</p>
            <p begin="1:11.177" end="1:14.437" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1">서로 좋아 죽는 바보 바보</p>
